# Native Mathieu Sylow certificates

Small tables for a 129-pair orbit certificate. The parent tree is retained from the 256-pair diagnostic; only a strict lower bound of 128 is needed for the two-group order argument.

These are the finite certificates for H.12.1(9) and 14.4.12, printed
pp.393–394 and 1011–1012. See `source/README.md` for data provenance.
-/

